extends layout.pug

block title
  | #{subject}

block content
  - const videoUrl = "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fR7Upo0DlYs&t=125s"
  if copy === "control"
    p Hi #{name},

    p You’re almost done! You’ve created an account on the Alliance platform, but did not complete the membership agreement. Please note that until you do, you will be unable to participate in our projects.

    p You can complete the membership agreement here:
    +button(link, "Join the Alliance")

    p The agreement matters because the Alliance is built on reliability. We plan precise actions based on the number of committed members; every commitment tells us who we can count on.

    p By completing it, you’re telling other members that they can count on you. Because they’ve completed it, you can count on them too. The world needs you.

    p
      | If you’d like to learn more about the Alliance and why reliability matters before joining, you can watch 
      a(href=videoUrl) this video
      | .

    p Thank you for your interest in the Alliance.

    p Best,
    p The Alliance Team
  else if copy === "agreement_v1"
    p Hi #{name},

    p You created an Alliance account, but did not enter into our membership agreement. Our project planning relies upon accurate participation expectations. Until you enter into the agreement, we cannot assign you tasks.

    p By entering into it, you are letting other members know they can count on you, just like you can count on them.

    p You can enter into the agreement here:
    +button(link, "Become a member")

    p
      | If you would like to learn more about the Alliance and why reliability matters before joining, you can watch this video: 
      a(href=videoUrl)= videoUrl

    p Best,
    p The Alliance Team
  else
    - throw new Error(`unknown contract reminder copy: ${copy}`)
